OL,3,GNEWSARacially aggravated damage at
OL,4,AIslamic centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FDamage to an Islamic community centre
OL,7,Fis being treated as racially
OL,8,Faggravated, police have said.
OL,10,FHasan Kilik, 41, one of the voluntary
OL,11,FImam's at the Cornwall Islamic
OL,12,FCommunity Centre near Truro, said the
OL,13,Fbuilding on Quenchwell Road was
OL,14,Ftargeted on Thursday night.
OL,16,FDevon and Cornwall Police said
OL,17,F"substantial damage" to metal entrance
OL,18,Fgates was thought to have been caused
OL,19,Fby a vehicle, and said an "unknown
OL,20,Fsubstance, possibly oil" was poured
OL,21,Fwithin the grounds and on an exterior
OL,22,Fwall.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
