OL,3,GNEWSARacially aggravated damage at
OL,4,AIslamic centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FKilik said community members sometimes
OL,7,Ffelt "on edge" when similar incidents
OL,8,Fhappened in other parts of the country,
OL,9,Fbut added "when this happens here in
OL,10,FCornwall, they're going to be feeling
OL,11,Fextra emotional".
